    "text": "冰的，它有點像，對，",
    "speaker": "spk_1"
   },
   {
    "start": 7.07,
    "end": 9.979,
    "text": "我剛剛看它，它顏色也很像葷。",
    "speaker": "spk_2"
   },
   {
    "start": 11.81,
    "end": 12.229,
    "text": "他。",
    "speaker": "spk_1"
   },
   {
    "start": 14.6,
    "end": 17.648,
    "text": "他剛剛有那個咕嘟咕嘟的聲音。",
    "speaker": "spk_2"
   },
   {
    "start": 18.25,
    "end": 18.3,
    "text": "很",
    "speaker": "spk_2"
   },
   {
    "start": 19.209,
    "end": 20.889,
    "text": "可愛的，小心他會划走哦，",
    "speaker": "spk_1"
   },
   {
